Sample inbound and status payloads used by the parser tests.

whatsapp_*.json: End User Messaging Social SNS message with the Meta webhook entry as a JSON string in
  whatsAppWebhookEntry. Message objects follow the Meta Cloud API webhook reference (text, audio, button with
  button.payload and context.id, statuses). The exact SNS envelope is confirmed on the first real event.
sms_inbound.json, rcs_postback.json: two-way SMS payload fields (originationNumber, destinationNumber,
  messageKeyword, messageBody, inboundMessageId). The RCS postback field name is confirmed on the first real tap.
sms_delivered.json, rcs_read.json: End User Messaging SMS configuration set event records.
ses_delivery.json: SES configuration set event record (eventType, mail.messageId).
All numbers are fictional.
